[{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0001","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-0160","title":"OpenSSL TLS/DTLS 心跳扩展缓冲区越界读取漏洞（心脏滴血）","description":"OpenSSL 1.0.1 至 1.0.1f 版本中的 TLS 和 DTLS 实现未正确验证 Heartbeat 扩展包的长度字段，存在缓冲区越界读取漏洞（CWE-125）。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证，即可通过向目标服务器发送精心构造的 Heartbeat 请求包，从服务器进程内存中读取最多 64KB 的敏感数据，包括私钥、会话密钥、用户密码和会话 Cookie 等。该漏洞被称为心脏滴血（Heartbleed），影响全球约 17% 的 HTTPS 服务器，攻击者可在不留下任何日志痕迹的情况下持续窃取内存数据，危害极为严重。OpenSSL 1.0.1g 版本已修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2014-0160"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-04-07T22:55:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:02:24Z","remediation":"立即升级 OpenSSL 至 1.0.1g 或更高版本（1.0.2、1.1.0 等），或重新编译 OpenSSL 时添加 -DOPENSSL_NO_HEARTBEATS 禁用心跳扩展。同时撤销所有现有 TLS 证书并重新签发，更换服务器私钥，强制用户重置密码和会话令牌。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://advisories.mageia.org/MGASA-2014-0165.html","http://blog.fox-it.com/2014/04/08/openssl-heartbleed-bug-live-blog/","http://cogentdatahub.com/ReleaseNotes.html","http://download.schneider-electric.com/files?p_Doc_Ref=SEVD%202014-119-01","http://git.openssl.org/gitweb/?p=openssl.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=96db9023b881d7cd9f379b0c154650d6c108e9a3","http://heartbleed.com/","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2014-April/131221.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2014-April/131291.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2014-August/136473.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2014-04/msg00004.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2014-04/msg00005.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-updates/2014-04/msg00061.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=139722163017074&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=139757726426985&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=139757819327350&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=139757919027752&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=139758572430452&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=139765756720506&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=1397