bleed","https://github.com/musalbas/heartbleed-masstest","https://github.com/titanous/heartbleeder","https://github.com/Lekensteyn/pacemaker","https://github.com/sensepost/heartbleed-poc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0168","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-1761","title":"Microsoft Word RTF解析远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Word 在处理特制 RTF 格式文档时存在对象混淆漏洞（CWE-787），由于对 RTF 文件中对象类型的验证不充分，攻击者可构造恶意的 RTF 文档，通过诱导用户打开触发内存破坏，最终实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Word 2003/2007/2010/2013 及 SharePoint Server、Office Web Apps 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。该漏洞已在 2014 年 3 月被 MiniDuke APT 组织在野利用，Microsoft 于 MS14-017 安全公告中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-1761"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-03-25T13:24:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:05:31Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2014 年 4 月安全更新 MS14-017 (KB2953092)，该更新修复了 Word RTF 解析器中的内存损坏问题。受影响版本包括 Word 2003 SP3、2007 SP3、2010 SP1/SP2、2013 及 2013 RT。如无法立即打补丁，可启用 Microsoft 增强缓解体验工具包 (EMET) 或通过组策略禁用 Word 打开 RTF 文件关联作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://technet.microsoft.com/security/advisory/2953095","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2014/ms14-017","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-1761","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/32793","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-1761.md","https://github.com/houjingyi233/office-exploit-case-study/blob/09de49e31b83b4348c9e892bfde1ef1f597bc38a/CVE-2014-1761/README.md","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/crowdstrike_cve-2014-1761-alley-compromise.txt","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-1761","https://github.com/eset/malware-research/blob/f9dc5cb47981b3d584b3aecce8524ab01659348a/miniduke/README.adoc","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2014/CVE-2014-1761.json","https://github.com/decalage2/oletools/blob/ec10260989dbc48b9109e3d05d22beee19cf2333/oletools/common/clsid.py","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/local-exploits/22117.txt","https://github.com/RedDrip7/APT_Digital_Weapon/blob/cc4cde356dcb4455419d80aedc3bba471249f167/BITTER/BITTER_hash.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0206","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-2120","title":"Cisco ASA WebVPN 登录页面跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Cisco Adaptive Security Appliance (ASA) 软件的 WebVPN 登录页面存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向 WebVPN 登录页面的未指定参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当管理员或用户访问特制的登录页面时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞影响 Cisco ASA 8.4.7 及之前版本、9.1.4 及之前版本，Cisco 已发布安全公告（Bug ID CSCun19025）并提供修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2014-2120"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-03-19T01:15:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:06:05Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco ASA 软件至 8.4.8 及以上版本或 9.1.5 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法立即升级，可在 WebVPN 配置中启用 HTTP 严格传输安全（HSTS）并禁用未使用的 WebVPN 门户功能，同时在 ASA 上配置全局内容安全策略（CSP）以缓解 XSS 攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityNotice/CVE-2014-2120","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/66290","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1029935","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-2120","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-2120.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2014/2xxx/CVE-2014-2120.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-2120","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2014/2xxx/CVE-2014-2120.json","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/326d1eb3c211c5432d4f6357a04093f6484ab9cc/archive/2024/2024-12-04.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2014-2120.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2014-2120.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CVE-2014-2120-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/d206e936b7c9c49da608b2e68f805e3421c7432a/data_single/2014/CVE-2014-2120.csv","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/4b186187e26ab7d33530960045e63f7b32a649f8/doc/2024-12/%E6%80%9D%E7%A7%91ASA%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9ECVE-2014-2120%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E8%A2%AB%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0206.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0009","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-2323","title":"Lighttpd mod_mysql_vhost SQL注入漏洞","description":"Lighttpd 的 mod_mysql_vhost 模块存在 SQL 注入漏洞（CVE-2014-2323），该模块在处理 HTTP 请求中的主机名（Host 头）时，未对用户输入进行充分过滤和转义便直接拼接至 SQL 查询语句中。远程攻击者无需身份认证，仅需向运行 lighttpd（版本低于 1.4.35）的服务器发送特制请求，即可在目标系统上执行任意 SQL 命令，可能导致数据库信息泄露、数据篡改甚至远程代码执行。CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-2323"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-03-14T15:55:05Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:06:24Z","remediation":"升级 lighttpd 至 1.4.35 或更高版本，该版本已修复 mod_mysql_vhost 模块中 hostname 参数导致的 SQL 注入漏洞。如无法升级，可在配置中禁用 mod_mysql_vhost 模块，或使用 WAF 规则过滤恶意 Host 请求头作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://download.lighttpd.net/lighttpd/security/lighttpd_sa_2014_01.txt","http://jvn.jp/en/jp/JVN37417423/index.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2014-03/msg00023.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2014-04/msg00002.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2014-04/msg00006.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=141576815022399&w=2","http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2014/q1/561","http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2014/q1/564","http://secunia.com/advisories/57404","http://secunia.com/advisories/57514","http://www.debian.org/security/2014/dsa-2877","http://www.lighttpd.net/2014/3/12/1.4.35/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-2323.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-2323.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2014/CVE-2014-2323.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38d69eac06b18def83031c01f4b3a1684895ad06/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-2323.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-2323/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-2323.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2014-2323_4.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/info/cve-2014-2323-2304.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-2323_1.yaml","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2014/UBUNTU-CVE-2014-2323.json","https://github.com/zeroChen00/vulnerability_database/blob/4df60c1aafa2a270ad62f9812603bf68cc5a2340/2022/nuclei_pocs/CVE-2014-2323.yaml","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2014-2323","https://github.com/cirocosta/lighty-sqlinj-demo"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0008","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-2321","title":"ZTE F460 F660 光猫 web_shell_cmd 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"ZTE F460 和 F660 光猫的 web_shell_cmd.gch 接口存在访问控制缺陷漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过发送特制的 sendcmd 请求（如使用 set TelnetCfg 命令）启用 Telnet 服务并设置任意登录凭据，从而获得设备的完全管理权限。攻击者可利用该漏洞完全控制目标设备，进行流量劫持、DNS 篡改或构建僵尸网络。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，受影响的设备需通过固件升级或禁用 Telnet 服务进行修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2014-2321"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-03-11T13:01:19Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:06:24Z","remediation":"升级光猫固件至厂商发布的最新版本（如涉及）；在 Web 管理界面关闭 Telnet 远程访问功能；在防火墙或 ACL 规则中限制对光猫 80/443 管理端口的访问来源 IP；删除或重命名 web_shell_cmd.gch 脚本文件以阻断未授权执行路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/600724","http://www.myxzy.com/post-411.html","https://community.rapid7.com/community/infosec/blog/2014/03/03/disclosure-r7-2013-18-zte-f460-and-zte-f660-webshellcmdgch-backdoor","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-2321.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-2321.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2014/CVE-2014-2321.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-2321.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2014-2321-2300.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-2321/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-2321.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2014-2321-2296_1.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2014-2321-2299.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-2321_1.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2014-2321.yaml","https://github.com/0xelixer/new/blob/6f6dd4a43a76ce74c1e8cc0558629a2ea198286e/nuclei-temps/cent/template1/cve-2014-2321-2296.yaml","https://github.com/injectionmethod/ZTE-Vuln-4-Skids","https://github.com/injectionmethod/Windows-ZTE-Loader"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2014/POC-AVE-2014-0008.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2014/EXP-AVE-2014-0008.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0106","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-0502","title":"Adobe Flash Player 双重释放远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 和 Adobe AIR 存在双重释放内存漏洞，源于 Flash Player 在处理特定矢量图形对象时存在内存管理缺陷，导致同一内存块被重复释放。攻击者可通过诱导用户访问包含恶意 Flash 内容的网页或打开恶意文档，触发双重释放漏洞实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows/Mac OS X 上 11.7.700.269 版本前及 11.8.x 至 12.0.0.70 版本前的 Flash Player，Linux 上 11.2.202.341 版本前，Android 上 4.0.0.1628 版本前的 AIR，以及同版本前的 AIR SDK 与 Compiler。CVSS 3.1 评分 8.8（HIGH），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，需用户交互，无需权限，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性完全丧失。该漏洞于 2014 年 2 月已在野利用，被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，Adobe 已发布安全更新修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-0502"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-02-21T05:07:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:03:09Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 11.7.700.269 或 12.0.0.70 及以上版本（Windows/Mac），Linux 升级至 11.2.202.341 及以上版本，Android 升级 Adobe AIR 至 4.0.0.1628 及以上版本；若暂时无法更新，请在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件（Chrome 访问 chrome://settings/content/flash 设为\"阻止\"，Firefox 禁用 Shockwave Flash 插件），并参考 Adobe 官方安全公告 APSB14-07 应用补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb14-07.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2014-02/msg00014.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2014-02/msg00015.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2014-02/msg00017.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2014-0196.html","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201405-04.xml","http://www.alienvault.com/open-threat-exchange/blog/analysis-of-an-attack-exploiting-the-adobe-zero-day-cve-2014-0502/","https://volatility-labs.blogspot.com/2014/04/building-decoder-for-cve-2014-0502.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-0502","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-0502.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2014/0xxx/CVE-2014-0502.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-0502","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2014/0xxx/CVE-2014-0502.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2014/CVE-2014-0502/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2014-0502.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2014-0502.html","https://github.com/aldaor/HackerOneReports/blob/1e71d1e9ac68e9adc923fe9bbd809aac776befe3/MemoryCorruptionGeneric/2170.txt","https://github.com/forensicswiki/wiki/blob/4b85090e7d43669f2a721f18aa4cf7bb262cb69a/docs/malware.md","https://github.com/riusksk/vul_war/blob/c9c5b9b0e0649997259323423a634b80763aef0f/abstract_contents_english.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0088","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0088.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-0322","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer Use-After-Free远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 9 和 10 存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 JavaScript 代码，利用 CMarkup 对象与 script 元素的 onpropertychange 属性触发内存释放后的非法访问，进而在当前用户权限上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞已在 2014 年 1 月至 2 月期间被野外利用，攻击者通常通过水坑攻击或恶意邮件链接诱导用户访问恶意网页触发。影响 Windows 平台上 IE 9 和 IE 10 所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 MS14-012 安全公告中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-0322"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-02-14T16:55:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:02:47Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2014 年 4 月安全更新 MS14-012 (KB2925418)，该补丁修复了 Internet Explorer 9 和 10 中的 CMarkup 释放后使用漏洞。如无法立即打补丁，可启用 Enhanced Mitigation Experience Toolkit (EMET) 并配置 IE 为高安全级别，同时限制用户访问不受信任网站作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://community.websense.com/blogs/securitylabs/archive/2014/02/13/msie-0-day-exploit-cve-2014-0322-possibly-targeting-french-aerospace-organization.aspx","http://technet.microsoft.com/security/advisory/2934088","http://twitter.com/nanoc0re/statuses/434251658344673281","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/32851","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/32904","http://www.fireeye.com/blog/technical/cyber-exploits/2014/02/new-ie-zero-day-found-in-watering-hole-attack-2.html","http://www.fireeye.com/blog/uncategorized/2014/02/operation-snowman-deputydog-actor-compromises-us-veterans-of-foreign-wars-website.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/732479","